tcommon\tshares\tin\t2012.\n\n# CREDIT\tDERIVATIVES\n\nThe\tcredit\tderivative\tunderlying\tis\tbased\ton\tthe\tcredit\trisk\tof\ta\tspecific\tentity,\tentities,\tor\tan\tindex.\tAs\tdiscussed\tabove,\twe\tenter\tinto\tcredit\tderivatives,\tspecifically credit\tdefault\tswaps\tand\trisk\tparticipation\tagreements,\tas\tpart\tof\tour\tcommercial\tmortgage\tbanking\thedging\tactivities\tand\tfor\tcustomer\tand\tother\trisk\tmanagement purposes.\tDetail\tregarding\tcredit\tdefault\tswaps\tand\trisk\tparticipations\tsold\tfollows.\n\n# Table\t138:\tCredit\tDefault\tSwaps\n\n|  | December\t31,\t2012 | December\t31,\t2012 |  | December\t31,\t2011 | December\t31,\t2011 |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Dollars\\tin\\tmillions | Notional\\nAmount | Fair\\nValue | Weighted-\\nAverage\\nRemaining\\nMaturity\\nIn\\tYears | Notional\\nAmount | Fair\\nValue | Weighted-\\nAverage\\nRemaining\\nMaturity\\nIn\\tYears |\n| Credit\\tDefault\\tSwaps\\t–\\tSold\\t(a) |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Single\\tname |  |  |  | $45 | $2 | 1.8 |\n| Index\\ttraded |  |  |  | 49 |  | 2.0 |\n| Total |  |  |  | $94 | $2 | 1.9 |\n| Credit\\tDefault\\tSwaps\\t–\\tPurchased |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Single\\tname | $50 |  | 5.8 | $150 | $5 | 3.8 |\n| Index\\ttraded | 60 | $2 | 36.1 | 60 | 4 | 37.2 |\n| Total | $110 | $2 | 22.4 | $210 | $9 | 13.3 |\n| Total | $110 | $2 | 22.4 | $304 | $11 | 9.8 |\n| (a) |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n(a) There\twere\tno\tcredit\tdefault\tswaps\tsold\tas\tof\tDecember\t31,\t2012.\n\nThe\tnotional\tamount\tof\tthese\tcredit\tdefault\tswaps\tby\tcredit\trating\tfollows:\n\n# Table\t139:\tCredit\tRatings\tof\tCredit\tDefault\tSwaps\n\n| Investment\tgrade\t(b) |  | $84 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Subinvestment\\tgrade\\t(c) |  | 10 |\n| Total |  | $94 |\n| Credit\\tDefault\\tSwaps\\t–\\tPurchased |  |  |\n| Investment\\tgrade\\t(b) | $95 | $145 |\n| Subinvestment\\tgrade\\t(c) | 15 | 65 |\n| Total | $110 | $210 |\n| Total | $110 | $304 |\n\n(b) Investment\tgrade\t